# COOKIES_FILE_CONTENT: Base64-encoded cookies.txt file content (Netscape format).
# Export cookies from your browser while logged into YouTube/Instagram/Facebook
# to allow the server to access login-walled content.
# Set this as a secret environment variable in your hosting platform dashboard
# (Vercel, Render, etc.). Never commit the raw cookies.txt file to git.
# COOKIES_FILE_CONTENT=<base64-encoded-cookies>
